	-> helm : Helm is the package manager for Kubernetes. It helps you define, install, and upgrade applications on a Kubernetes cluster, from a single container to an application with many interdependent parts.
Deploying an application to Kubernetes means writing and maintaining many manifests: Deployments, Services, ConfigMaps, and more.
		- help provide all services of k8s just by installing helm
		- helm package <app_name>
		- helm install <release_name> <chart_name> -n <namespace_name> --create-namespace
		- helm upgrade <release-name> <chart>
		- helm rollback <release-name> <revision>
		
		
